# These macros are run by two interpreters and each leaves its own bytecode beside
# the source: CPython when a script is imported as a module or its tests are run,
# Jython whenever Fiji executes it. Both are regenerated on demand and neither
# belongs in the repo - a stale one committed here would be loaded in preference to
# the source it no longer matches.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
